OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 19 Nov to Sat 28 NovFA
OL,6,Fchangeable pattern is likely to
OL,7,Fcontinue, with areas of rain or
OL,8,Fshowers affecting parts of the UK,
OL,9,Fparticularly across the south and
OL,10,Fwest. These will be interspersed with
OL,11,Fdrier, colder interludes as shorter-
OL,12,Flived ridges of high pressure develop.
OL,13,FWeather patterns may become slower
OL,14,Fevolving during the latter stages of
OL,15,FNovember, leading to some uncertainty
OL,16,Fover how much progress Atlantic
OL,17,Ffrontal systems will make into the UK.
OL,18,FNonetheless, further rain or showers
OL,19,Fare likely at times, with the
OL,20,Fpotential for some periods of strong
OL,21,Fwinds. Incursions of milder air are
OL,22,Flikely towards the south, although it
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fcould remain on the cold side overall
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Ffurther north, where there is
OL,25,Fpotential for overnight frosts and
OL,26,Foccasional wintry precipitation,
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
